<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp dual samurais. [CORRECTED 05:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp dual samurais. [CORRECTED 05:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Standard and Poor's corrects rating from AA- to AA in headline and text.)</p>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it had assigned an AA rating to New South Wales Treasury Corp's 20 billion yen worth of 5.45 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency bonds due April 7, 2000.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that the outlook for the bond was positive.</p>
</text>
